{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51706","headline":"咏灧澦堆 · 刘隐辞","name":"咏灧澦堆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灧澦崔嵬百万秋，年年出没几时休。\n未容寸土生纤草，能向当江覆巨舟。\n无事便腾千尺浪，与人长作一堆愁。\n都缘不似蟠溪石，难使渔翁下钓鈎。\n（以上《监诫录》五《因诗辱》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘隐辞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}